From 7ea4db466d6824e62f2f6286d5437e1e14a12555 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanju Abraham <s.abraham@f5.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 14:09:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] security: bump x/sys v0.42.0 -> v0.45.0, axios 1.15.2 ->
 1.16.1, vitest 2.1.9/4.0.18 -> 4.1.0, yaml 2.6.0 -> 2.8.3

Fixes the following CVEs flagged by CI:

  golang.org/x/sys v0.42.0:
    CVE-2026-39824 (3.3)

  axios 1.15.2 (ui):
    CVE-2026-44489 (3.7), CVE-2026-44490 (4.8),
    CVE-2026-44492 (8.6), CVE-2026-44494 (8.7)

  vitest 2.1.9 (tests/integrations/typescript) and 4.0.18 (ui):
    CVE-2026-47429 (9.8)
    (also bumps @vitest/coverage-v8 and @vitest/ui to 4.1.0 to match)
    (transitive vite is pulled to >= 8.0.5, which fixes CVE-2026-39365)

  yaml 2.6.0 (tests/integrations/typescript):
    CVE-2026-33532 (4.3)

Applied directly to the base source rather than via the f5xc-patches
overlay system because container-image security scans run against the
checked-out base tree before make apply-patches has had a chance to run.
A reference copy of this change set lives under f5xc-patches/security/
for audit purposes.
---
 cli/go.mod                                    |    2 +-
 cli/go.sum                                    |    4 +-
 examples/plugins/hello-world/go.mod           |    2 +-
 examples/plugins/hello-world/go.sum           |    4 +-
 .../integrations/typescript/package-lock.json | 2653 +++++++----------
 tests/integrations/typescript/package.json    |    8 +-
 ui/package-lock.json                          |  682 +----
 ui/package.json                               |    4 +-
 8 files changed, 1135 insertions(+), 2224 deletions(-)

